DE:
{{TAG:0003:0003:}}Au fein!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Mit {{TAG:0005:0008:}} Verstecken
spielen!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Juhuuu!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0023:}}Äh, he he he...{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Das wird aber richtig
schwierig, gegen mich zu gewinnen!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Ich spiel nämlich jeden Tag!{{TAG:0007:0008:58020000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Ich frag noch ein paar Leute, ob
sie auch mitspielen wollen,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!{{TAG:0007:0008:58020000}}

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0020:}}You have a reputation as being a
real shark, {{TAG:0005:0008:}},{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} so take it
easy on me, OK?{{TAG:0007:0008:58020000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Oh, I know.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} I'll ask some other
people to play too.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} That'll make
things more fun,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!{{TAG:0007:0008:58020000}}

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0020:}}Tienes la reputación de ser
una fiera, {{TAG:0005:0008:}},{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} así que
no te ensañes conmigo, ¿vale?{{TAG:0007:0008:58020000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Ah, ya sé.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Le pediré a más gente
que juegue.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} ¡Así esto será más
divertido,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!{{TAG:0007:0008:58020000}}

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0020:}}Mi hanno detto che tu sei un vero
portento a nascondino, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Beh, vacci piano, OK?{{TAG:0007:0008:58020000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Ah, senti,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} ti dispiace se invito
anche altri giocatori?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Più siamo,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
meglio è, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!{{TAG:0007:0008:58020000}}

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}{{TAG:0007:000B:}}Eh, mais ?!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Je n'avais pas vu qu'il
était aussi tard !{{TAG:0007:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0009:}} Tant pis. On ne
joue pas à cache-cache la nuit.
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}C'est plutôt l'heure d'aller dormir.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Mais pas avant un bon petit dîner,
bien sûr,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}} ! {{TAG:0003:0025:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}{{TAG:0007:000B:}}Caspitina!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Hai visto che ore sono?!
{{TAG:0007:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0009:}}È tardissimo per giocare.
Direi che è meglio rimandare!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0002:}}Quando fa buio,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} trovare la gente
è tutt'altro che una passeggiata!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
È normale: non si vede un tubo!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}{{TAG:0007:000B:}}Aah!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Saate bak!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0009:}} Bugün oynamak
için çok geç oldu, başka zaman oynayalım.
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}Çok karanlık olursa,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} kim
saklanmış anlayamazsın,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
çünkü hiçbir şey göremezsin!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}
